OL,3,GNEWSASchools to close on Friday due to
OL,4,AStorm Austen
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll schools have been told to close on
OL,7,FFriday because of the high winds
OL,8,Fpredicted to be caused by Storm Austen,
OL,9,Fthe Government of Jersey has said.
OL,11,FWinds of up to 80mph are set to hit
OL,12,FJersey on Friday morning, with a red
OL,13,Fwind warning expected to be issued for
OL,14,Fthe Channel Islands on Thursday.
OL,16,FThe Minister for Education and Lifelong
OL,17,FLearning made the decision to close all
OL,18,FGovernment of Jersey schools "as early
OL,19,Fas possible to give families time to
OL,20,Forganise childcare arrangements".
